<title>UK: UK shares end roller-coaster day down on Dow slide.</title>
<headline>UK shares end roller-coaster day down on Dow slide.</headline>
<text>
<p>** FTSE 100 ends sharply lower as Wall Street plunges 100</p>
<p>	 points during London trading hours.</p>
<p>** Market fears Dow could be due for major correction after</p>
<p>	 its meteoric rise this year.</p>
<p>** Burmah ends higher on short covering, weak crude price.</p>
</text>
